==Description==
The '''Tan Camo Nametag''' is a nametag that could have been obtained from Sergeant I rank of the [[PVP Season 0]].

The '''Tan Camo Nametag''' has text with a brown gradient and a dark brown outline. A light brown camo background can be seen behind the text. An icon of the Sergeant rank can be seen next to the text. 

